cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use dsh-desktop-acrylic, please cite it as below."
title: "dsh-desktop-acrylic: Tokyo Night themes for DeepSeek Harness Desktop"
abstract: >-
  Dark and light Tokyo Night themes for DeepSeek Harness Desktop, implemented as real themes
  registered into the built-in theme runtime. Adds translucent surfaces, a material base layer,
  frosted panels and popovers, and a searchable picker for the monospace families installed on
  the machine.
